ption-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q22\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>stops working.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q22\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>displays incorrect data.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">23</strong> Timetabling has become an issue because</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>there is not enough time for anyone to do it.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>the system does not handle course options.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>the courses are constantly changing.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">24</strong> To solve the timetabling issues, Randhir suggests that</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>students should create their own timetables.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>Dave should have someone to assist him.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>the number of courses should be reduced.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">25</strong> Randhir says that a new system may</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>need to be trialled.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>still have problems.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>be more economical.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">26</strong> Improving the existing system will take</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>a few weeks.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>four or five months.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>nine months.</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":6},{"id":"en-official-guide-t1-l-g3-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 27-30","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the flow-chart below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS for each answer.</p><p>Next steps</p><p>Get approval from <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">27</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>↓</p><p>Complete a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">28</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q28\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> form</p><p>↓</p><p>Book a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">29</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q29\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> with the systems analyst</p><p>↓</p><p>Set up a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">30</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> with technologies team</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":4}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/official_cambridge_guide_to_ielts_academic_listening_test_1_3.mp3"],"order_index":3},{"id":"en-official-guide-t1-l-p4","title":"Part 4","part_number":4,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3131418-official_cambridge_guide_to_ielts_academic_listening_test_1_4.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-official-guide-t1-l-g4-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 31-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the sentences below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.</p><ul><li>Ceramics date back approximately <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">31</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q31\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li><li>The first figurines were made in the area of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">32</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q32\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li><li>Early humans could not use their pots to store <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">33</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q33\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li><li>The Chinese improved the quality of ceramics by mixing <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> with the clay.</li><li>Chinese porcelain was also called <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li><li>Bottger added quartz and <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> to clay to make porcelain.</li><li>Glass production is similar to clay ceramics apart from the rate of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li><li>The Romans introduced the use of glass to make <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li><li>The discovery of concrete is probably due to observing reactions of water and <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li><li>The ability to build large <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t1-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> contributed to the success of the Roman Empire.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/official_cambridge_guide_to_ielts_academic_listening_test_1_4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-official-guide-t1-l-q1","part_id":"en-official-guide-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-official-guide-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"café/cafe","correct_answer_variants":["café","cafe"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3130154_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-official-guide-t1-l-q2","part_id":"en-official-guide-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-official-guide-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"9 am/nine am/9 o'clock/nine o'clock","correct_answer_variants":["9 am","nine am","9 o'clock","nine o'clock"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[2],